id: SCA-043
title: Gemfile with eval or system call
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Gemfile
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: \b(eval|system|exec)\b\s*[\(\(]
    message: Dynamic code execution in Gemfile — can execute arbitrary commands during bundle install. Gemfile is Ruby code that runs at dependency resolution time.
fix: Gemfile should only contain source, gem, and group declarations. Remove any dynamic code execution.
